('APX-C-5103', '5103', 'Video Focused on an Intimate Scene Inside a Massive', 'Create a cinematic 15-second vertical video focused on an intimate scene inside a massive futuristic football stadium at golden hour sunset turning into electric night.', 15, '9:16', 'https://x.com/AiwithShoaib/status/2057422501706453348', 'Create a hyper-realistic, cinematic 15-second vertical video focused on an intimate scene inside a massive futuristic football stadium at golden hour sunset turning into electric night. Start with a dynamic camera circling a young handsome man with dark wavy hair, black-rimmed glasses, bright smiling face, wearing a black suit jacket over a white shirt, sitting closely with a stunning beautiful young woman with long flowing dark hair and elegant outfit. Both are passionately watching the live football match. Show energetic football players on the green pitch under blazing floodlights – fast dribbling, powerful shots, and a dramatic goal. Capture the couple cheering excitedly together, jumping up, hugging each other in joy as the crowd roars, flags wave, and fireworks explode in the sky. End with a close-up of their happy faces glowing with stadium lights and sparks. Ultra-detailed 8K resolution, cinematic color grading, epic motion, particles of light and energy, fast-paced dynamic camera movements, breathtaking romantic + high-energy atmosphere that instantly impresses and gives goosebumps. High energy couple vibe, no text, no voiceover, perfect 15-second duration', null, null, 'missing', 3, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', 'golden-hour', '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: sport, fashion', 'seedance_2.0', '@AiwithShoaib', 'https://x.com/AiwithShoaib', null, null),
('APX-C-5099', '5099', 'Fragile Swamp Dock Becomes a Collapsing Trap as Something', 'A fragile swamp dock becomes a collapsing trap as something massive moves beneath it. The danger isn’t just the creature — it’s the ground giving way in pieces, forcing constant repositioning.', null, null, 'https://x.com/rahulnanda86/status/2057409660022558927', 'A fragile swamp dock becomes a collapsing trap as something massive moves beneath it. The danger isn’t just the creature — it’s the ground giving way in pieces, forcing constant repositioning.

SETTING (LOCKED)
Louisiana bayou, late afternoon golden light, still dark water reflecting trees, Spanish moss hanging low, thick humidity, old wooden dock stretching over shallow swamp water, worn planks, gaps between boards, algae and mud below.

⸻

0s–2s (HOOK)
Camera already handheld on the dock, slightly off-balance. A loud CRACK — the wooden planks beneath the lens suddenly split open. Through the gap — dark water churns violently and a massive shape passes just below. The camera jerks back as water splashes upward through the broken boards.

⸻

2s–5s
The dock starts failing in sections. Planks ahead buckle and drop one by one. Camera runs forward but has to stop — a gap opens suddenly. Someone jumps across. Camera follows, barely making it. Behind, another section collapses into the water.

⸻

5s–8s
Low angle — camera turns. The water below isn’t still anymore — it’s tracking movement. A huge back or head briefly breaks just beneath the surface between dock supports. The dock lifts slightly from underneath — then SLAMS back down.

⸻

8s–11s (CHAOS PEAK)
Everything destabilizes. The dock tilts sideways. Camera slides across wet wood, grabbing a post to stop. One of the vertical support posts snaps loose and falls, sending a splash upward. The structure is no longer flat — it’s angled and breaking in segments.

⸻

11s–15s (PAYOFF)
Camera regains footing for half a second.

Wood creaks underfoot. Suddenly — a massive hippo ERUPTS upward from the water right in front, mouth wide open. Impact — camera gets knocked backward, falling into murky water.

⸻

Key Visual Hook

The dock cracking open under the camera with something massive moving directly beneath the planks.', null, null, 'missing', 5, 'keep', 'pass', 'aspirational', 'stylized-real', null, '24fps-cinematic', 'none', null, 'offline real-world gate: real-world: handheld', 'seedance_2.0', '@rahulnanda86', 'https://x.com/rahulnanda86', null, null),
