('APX-S-5350-1', 'APX-C-5350', 1, null, null, null, 'Please create a 10-second vertical (9:16) ultra-realistic live-action documentary video using the attached storyboard image as an accurate visual blueprint. Strictly maintain the storyboard''s composition, chronological order, character evolution, and walking direction. Adding extra shots or changing the sequence is prohibited. [Visual Style] Ultra-realistic live-action film quality. High-budget documentary style like BBC Earth, NHK Special, or National Geographic. Realistic texture like historical reenactment films. Natural light-based.', null, null, 'Please create a 10-second vertical () live-action documentary video using the attached storyboard image as an accurate visual blueprint. Adding extra shots or changing the sequence is prohibited. [Visual Style] live-action film quality.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5350-2', 'APX-C-5350', 2, null, null, null, 'Cinematic lighting. Photorealistic. Realistic skin, fur, clothing, stone tools, and natural environments. Cinematic depth. Intellectual and majestic atmosphere. [Video Composition] Duration: 10 seconds. Switch between the following 6 scenes from the storyboard in 1-6 order with equal duration: 1. Ape-man (early primate) 2. Australopithecus 3. Homo erectus 4. Neanderthal 5. Cro-Magnon 6. Modern Human Edit each scene to connect naturally. Emphasize the sense of gradual evolution over time. [Character Direction] The character continues to walk from left to right in all scenes.', null, null, '[Character Direction] The character continues to walk from left to right in all scenes.', null, null, null, null, null, 'awe'),
('APX-S-5350-3', 'APX-C-5350', 3, null, null, null, 'Walking speed is always constant. Ensure continuity of the same lineage across all scenes. As they evolve, the posture, facial features, physique, amount of hair, clothing, tools, and walking style evolve naturally. This should be an expression of evolution within the same lineage, not switching to a different person. [Camera] Maintain the same side-view composition in all scenes. Keep the camera distance constant. Always show the character''s full body. Smoothly follow the walking motion. Excessive camera work is prohibited. Natural shooting like a documentary film.', null, null, 'As they evolve, the posture, facial features, physique, amount of hair, clothing, tools, and walking style evolve naturally. Keep the camera distance constant. Always show the character''s full body.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5350-4', 'APX-C-5350', 4, null, null, null, '[Background Direction] The background environment also evolves naturally with each era: Forest, Grassland, Arid zone, Glacial zone, Mountainous zone, Modern city. Ensure environmental changes connect naturally. [Captions] Display short Japanese captions for each era. Content: Ape-man (early primate), Australopithecus, Homo erectus, Neanderthal, Cro-Magnon, Modern Human. Caption Style: Small, elegant, non-obstructive, semi-transparent, white or light gray, centered at the bottom, modest fade-in/fade-out. BBC Earth or NHK Special style.', null, null, '[Background Direction] The background environment also evolves naturally with each era: Forest, Grassland, Arid zone, Glacial zone, Mountainous zone, Modern city. Ensure environmental changes connect naturally.', null, null, null, null, 'forest', null),
('APX-S-5350-5', 'APX-C-5350', 5, null, null, null, 'Minimal elegant documentary-style typography. Important: Do not hide the character with captions. No flashy animations. No YouTube-style UI. No variety show style. [Music] Majestic and grand classical music evoking the beginning of the universe or human history. Intellectual and mysterious atmosphere. Emotional buildup like a movie trailer. [Important] Strictly refer to the uploaded storyboard. Maintain frame layout, era changes, and walking direction. The final video must not show the storyboard frame, annotations, UI, page info, or production notes.', null, null, 'Important: Do not hide the character with captions.', null, null, null, null, null, 'epic'),
('APX-S-5262-1', 'APX-C-5262', 1, null, null, null, 'Use as the strict locked identity reference. Preserve exact facial proportions, eye shape, jawline, lips, hairstyle silhouette, hair color distribution, and realistic skin texture. Maintain full facial consistency and realism. No stylization, beautification, or artificial enhancement. Ultra-realistic paparazzi-style telephoto street photograph of a Korean/Japanese young woman accidentally noticing the camera while walking through a busy Tokyo/Seoul evening street. The image must feel like an authentic hidden zoom-lens capture taken secretly from far away — not a fashion shoot, not cinematic AI art.', null, null, 'Paparazzi-style street photograph of a Korean/Japanese young woman accidentally noticing the camera while walking through a busy Tokyo/Seoul evening street.', null, null, null, null, 'tokyo, seoul', null),
