('APX-S-5155-1', 'APX-C-5155', 1, null, null, null, 'Create a cinematic ultra-realistic LEGO football short film strictly following the 12-panel storyboard sequence below. Do not add, remove, or change any scenes — follow the storyboard order and descriptions exactly. Style: Ultra cinematic LEGO realism, photorealistic LEGO textures, dramatic night stadium lighting, wet reflective grass, shallow depth of field, strong cinematic bokeh, volumetric god rays, FIFA broadcast energy mixed with Hollywood sports movie emotion.', null, null, 'Do not add, remove, or change any scenes — follow the storyboard order and descriptions exactly.', null, null, null, null, 'stadium', null),
('APX-S-5155-2', 'APX-C-5155', 2, null, null, null, 'France vs England rivalry, France team wearing blue jerseys, England team wearing white jerseys. Storyboard sequence to be followed strictly: 1. Epic aerial night shot of massive LEGO World Cup stadium with fireworks exploding. 2. LEGO fans cheering wildly with France and England flags waving and golden confetti falling. 3. Dramatic low-angle players walking out of smoky tunnel into the pitch.', null, null, 'France vs England rivalry, France team wearing blue jerseys, England team wearing white jerseys. Storyboard sequence to be followed strictly: 1. Epic aerial night shot of massive LEGO World Cup stadium with fireworks exploding.', null, null, null, null, 'stadium', 'epic'),
('APX-S-5155-3', 'APX-C-5155', 3, null, null, null, '4. Intense close-up face of French captain wearing blue jersey with dramatic rim lighting. 5. Tense face-to-face stare-down between French captain (blue jersey) and English captain (white jersey). 6. Fast-paced low tracking shot of English player dribbling the ball on wet reflective grass wearing white jersey. 7. Extreme macro close-up of LEGO foot perfectly controlling the ball with water droplets splashing.', null, null, 'Intense close-up face of French captain wearing blue jersey with dramatic rim lighting. Tense face-to-face stare-down between French captain (blue jersey) and English captain (white jersey).', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-5155-4', 'APX-C-5155', 4, null, null, null, '8. Powerful shot of French striker running and shooting the ball towards goal in blue jersey. 9. Dramatic slow-motion goal camera angle from behind the net — ball hitting the back of the net, goalkeeper diving late. 10. Explosive team celebration — French players in blue jerseys jumping, hugging, golden confetti raining heavily. 11. Emotional slow cinematic shot of sad English captain standing alone in white jersey as confetti falls around him.', null, null, 'Emotional slow shot of sad English captain standing alone in white jersey as confetti falls around him.', null, 'sprinting; leaping', null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-5155-5', 'APX-C-5155', 5, null, null, null, '12. Final heroic low-angle shot of victorious French team lifting the World Cup trophy under fireworks and cheering crowd. Camera style: Dynamic Hollywood sports cinematography — use low angles, smooth tracking shots, dramatic slow motion where appropriate, emotional close-ups, and sweeping movements. Maintain consistent photorealistic LEGO style throughout. Additional requirements: Wet reflective grass in all pitch shots, strong volumetric lighting, beautiful bokeh, high detail, emotional storytelling, masterpiece quality, cinematic color grading.', null, null, 'Final heroic of victorious French team lifting the World Cup trophy under fireworks and cheering crowd. Camera style: Dynamic Hollywood sports cinematography — use low angles, smooth shots, dramatic where appropriate, emotional close-ups…', null, null, null, null, null, null),
