('APX-S-5141-1', 'APX-C-5141', 1, null, null, null, '⬇️ Ultra-detailed cinematic storyboard collage showing a hyper-realistic motorsport lifestyle short film, arranged in a clean 15-panel grid layout with black dividers and white typography labels for each shot, inspired by luxury commercial storyboards and Netflix cinematic shot lists. The main character is a rugged Asian man in his 30s–40s with sharp jawline, short styled black hair, trimmed beard, tattooed neck and arms, masculine facial structure, realistic skin pores, calm confident expression, based on modern luxury street-racing aesthetics. VISUAL STYLE: cinematic realism, hyper-detailed textures, dramatic lighting, Porsche Motorsport aesthetic, premium commercial photography, shallow depth of field, anamorphic lens flare, Kodak Vision3 35mm film look, moody shadows, dynamic contrast, realistic reflections, ultra-sharp details, documentary realism, luxury lifestyle mood.', null, null, 'The main character is a rugged Asian man in his 30s–40s with sharp jawline, short styled black hair, trimmed beard, tattooed neck and arms, masculine facial structure, skin pores, calm confident expression, based on modern luxury…', null, 'racing', null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-5141-2', 'APX-C-5141', 2, null, null, null, 'STORYBOARD PANELS: 1. Close-up high-angle shot of a black digital alarm clock showing “07:00” on a dark bedside table with books and car keys, cold blue morning lighting, minimal cinematic atmosphere. 2. Medium eye-level shot of the man lying in dark gray bedding wearing a white tank top, reaching out sleepily to turn off the alarm clock, soft morning shadows, cinematic bedroom lighting. 3. POV fridge shot from inside the refrigerator, the man with toothbrush in mouth opening the fridge door searching for food, cool fridge lighting mixed with warm apartment tones. 4. Medium side-angle breakfast scene, man eating eggs and toast while checking his smartphone beside a milk bottle, sunlight entering from floor-to-ceiling windows, modern luxury apartment kitchen.', null, null, 'POV fridge shot from inside the refrigerator, the man with toothbrush in mouth opening the fridge door searching for food, cool fridge lighting mixed with warm apartment tones.', null, null, null, null, 'bedroom, apartment, kitchen', null),
('APX-S-5141-3', 'APX-C-5141', 3, null, null, null, '5. Extreme close-up of the man putting on sunglasses and grabbing luxury car keys, tattooed hands visible, glossy reflections, high-end fashion commercial feel. 6. Medium interior car shot, man driving a black high-performance sports sedan through the city, motion blur outside windows, urban skyline reflections, wearing black racing jacket. 7. Extreme close-up of racing suit zipper being pulled upward, Porsche Motorsport style logos, PUMA branding, realistic fabric texture and stitching details. 8. Low-angle wide shot of a bright green Porsche 911 GT3 RS aggressively cornering on a professional racetrack, dramatic tire marks, speed sensation, cinematic motorsport photography. 9. Fast side tracking shot of the green Porsche speeding past the camera with intense motion blur and dynamic perspective distortion.', null, null, 'Extreme close-up of the man putting on sunglasses and grabbing luxury car keys, tattooed hands visible, glossy reflections, high-end fashion commercial feel.', null, 'driving; racing', null, null, 'skyline', 'intense'),
('APX-S-5141-4', 'APX-C-5141', 4, null, null, null, '10. In-car close-up of the driver wearing a professional racing helmet, focused eyes, dramatic reflections moving across visor, intense racing atmosphere. 11. Aerial drone wide shot of the green Porsche racing down a giant racetrack straightaway surrounded by grandstands and track barriers, high-speed cinematic energy. 12. Medium following shot in the pit lane, the man in full racing suit carrying his helmet while walking confidently among crew members and mechanics, documentary-style realism. 13. Medium shot of the driver high-fiving a bearded team member in front of the garage area, authentic motorsport victory emotion, warm natural sunlight. 14. Wide cinematic interior night shot, man sitting alone on a dark leather sofa drinking beer while watching racing footage on television, moody warm lamp lighting, emotional contrast.', null, null, 'In-car close-up of the driver wearing a professional racing helmet, focused eyes, dramatic reflections moving across visor, intense racing atmosphere.', 'driver', 'racing', 'beer', 'incidental', null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-5141-5', 'APX-C-5141', 5, null, null, null, '15. Extreme close-up of tattooed hand pressing the TV remote control, television shutting off, room falling into silence, emotional cinematic ending frame. LAYOUT: 15 storyboard panels in a professional film production layout, each panel numbered with clean white text labels and shot descriptions, black background borders, cinematic production board aesthetic, realistic movie previsualization style. COLOR GRADING: warm cinematic highlights mixed with cool shadows, teal-orange contrast, luxury commercial tones, realistic skin color, soft bloom highlights, subtle film grain. KEYWORDS: Cinematic, Hyper-realistic, Porsche Motorsport, Luxury lifestyle, Fast-paced editing, Moody lighting, Documentary realism, Morning routine aesthetic, Racing culture, Emotional cinematic storytelling, Netflix commercial style, Premium storyboard design, 8K ultra detail.', null, null, 'Extreme close-up of tattooed hand pressing the TV remote control, television shutting off, room falling into silence, emotional ending frame.', null, 'racing', null, null, null, null),
