('APX-S-5101-1', 'APX-C-5101', 1, null, null, null, null, 1, 308, 'A vast underwater abyss stretches endlessly beneath a dark cobalt ocean, faint sunlight cascading down in thin shimmering rays that ripple across jagged seabed cliffs and ancient coral-covered ruins.', null, null, null, null, 'ocean', null),
('APX-S-5101-2', 'APX-C-5101', 2, null, null, null, 'In the distance, a lone deep-sea explorer wearing a sleek futuristic diving suit swims steadily forward, illuminated only by soft reflections from the surrounding marine life. The camera slowly glides closer, creating an immersive cinematic feeling of isolation and wonder. The diver moves gracefully through a glowing underwater ecosystem filled with giant anemones, swaying soft corals, and swirling schools of silver fish that shift direction in perfect harmony.', null, null, 'The camera slowly glides closer, creating an immersive feeling of isolation and wonder.', null, null, 'fish', 'incidental', null, null),
('APX-S-5101-3', 'APX-C-5101', 3, null, null, null, null, 776, 327, 'Gentle trails of bubbles rise toward the unseen surface as the current flows naturally around the environment.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-5101-4', 'APX-C-5101', 4, null, null, null, null, 1104, 353, 'Near the ocean floor, the explorer discovers an enormous ancient shipwreck resting beneath layers of drifting sediment and marine overgrowth. Rusted metal structures emerge from the darkness like forgotten ruins of another era.', null, null, null, null, 'ocean', null),
