('APX-S-5099-1', 'APX-C-5099', 1, null, null, null, 'A fragile swamp dock becomes a collapsing trap as something massive moves beneath it. The danger isn’t just the creature — it’s the ground giving way in pieces, forcing constant repositioning. SETTING (LOCKED) Louisiana bayou, late afternoon golden light, still dark water reflecting trees, Spanish moss hanging low, thick humidity, old wooden dock stretching over shallow swamp water, worn planks, gaps between boards, algae and mud below. ⸻ 0s–2s (HOOK) Camera already handheld on the dock, slightly off-balance.', null, null, 'A fragile swamp dock becomes a collapsing trap as something massive moves beneath it. The danger isn’t just the creature — it’s the ground giving way in pieces, forcing constant repositioning.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5099-2', 'APX-C-5099', 2, null, null, null, 'A loud CRACK — the wooden planks beneath the lens suddenly split open. Through the gap — dark water churns violently and a massive shape passes just below. The camera jerks back as water splashes upward through the broken boards. ⸻ 2s–5s The dock starts failing in sections. Planks ahead buckle and drop one by one. Camera runs forward but has to stop — a gap opens suddenly.', null, null, 'The camera jerks back as water splashes upward through the broken boards.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5099-3', 'APX-C-5099', 3, null, null, null, 'Someone jumps across. Camera follows, barely making it. Behind, another section collapses into the water. ⸻ 5s–8s Low angle — camera turns. The water below isn’t still anymore — it’s tracking movement. A huge back or head briefly breaks just beneath the surface between dock supports. The dock lifts slightly from underneath — then SLAMS back down. ⸻ 8s–11s (CHAOS PEAK) Everything destabilizes.', null, null, 'Camera follows, barely making it. Behind, another section collapses into the water. ⸻ 5s–8s Low angle — camera turns. The water below isn’t still anymore — it’s movement.', null, 'leaping', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5099-4', 'APX-C-5099', 4, null, null, null, 'The dock tilts sideways. Camera slides across wet wood, grabbing a post to stop. One of the vertical support posts snaps loose and falls, sending a splash upward. The structure is no longer flat — it’s angled and breaking in segments. ⸻ 11s–15s (PAYOFF) Camera regains footing for half a second. Wood creaks underfoot.', null, null, 'Camera slides across wet wood, grabbing a post to stop. One of the vertical support posts snaps loose and falls, sending a splash upward. The structure is no longer flat — it’s angled and breaking in segments.', null, 'sliding', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5099-5', 'APX-C-5099', 5, null, null, null, 'Suddenly — a massive hippo ERUPTS upward from the water right in front, mouth wide open. Impact — camera gets knocked backward, falling into murky water. ⸻ Key Visual Hook The dock cracking open under the camera with something massive moving directly beneath the planks.', null, null, '⸻ Key Visual Hook The dock cracking open under the camera with something massive moving directly beneath the planks.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
